# Grind the hill's east curb down the 10%: the 17 cm curb is a 255 m grind line. Gravity along it
# against grind friction and air drag gives about 11.9 m/s on the 10% (it no longer accelerates
# forever). Balance gets harder the longer you grind (grind.balanceRamp, 12% per second): the
# balance bot holds it for well over 10 s.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 76 90 17.95 180
cmd 1 set skater.vel.y -6
cmd 1 set skater.vel.z -0.6
tap grind 3
bot balance
run 1500
expect event grindStart{line=hill_curb_east} within 2..6
expect no event grindEnd within 6..1500
expect max skater.speed < 12.2
expect skater.speed > 8.5 at 1200
